Cell["\<\
The warning appears because, despite the matching being at tree-level, \
matchmakereft always applies the evanescent shifts that contain one - loop \
order pieces, see https://gitlab.com/m4103/matchmaker-eft/-/issues/12. These \
one-loop shifts are removed when considering tree-level matching results.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9080215729027643`*^9, 3.9080216242649918`*^9}, {
  3.9080216568284388`*^9, 3.9080217099286623`*^9}, {3.9618115568050976`*^9, 
  3.9618116105967064`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f4edd3d6-d345-47af-a003-\
87dbac548da7"],

Cell["\<\
These functions work well with the addition of some UV flavour assumptions. \
\>", "Text",
