Cell["\<\
It works  with a multi - particle model as well . If one mass is specified, \
it assumes degenerate particles . If the number of numerical masses is less \
than the one detected by the parameterList function, it assumes that the \
remaining masses are degenerate with the last specified . See manual for \
details . Notice that tree - level can be indicated in the last argument with \
either 0, \"tree\" or \"Tree\" indistinctly. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8980699886462393`*^9, 3.898070012828568*^9}, {
