  "817ce3c3-7ac2-44d9-a24a-83e91995f163"],
 " is a heavy scalar EW quadruplet in the irrep ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "4"}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{"3", "/", "2"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "687c764a-19aa-46d2-898c-0f62f2e4edc8"],
 ". First, we print some cards for UV scans and the for the mass scan.\nThe \
UV assumptions are chosen to reproduce the results in arXiv:2209.00666.\nThe \
cards for this model have been used in arXiv: 2502.20453, 2504.05974, \
2505.00272, 2506.15390."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.963028690340601*^9, 3.96302873885361*^9}, {
