   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalXi]", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "06699318-a0ac-40a3-90b1-eab36ca3bf84"],
 " is a heavy scalar in the irrep ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", ",", "3"}], ")"}], "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4e0fded6-da80-431b-921e-44a428266a46"],
 ". First, we print some cards for UV scans and the for the mass scan.\nThe \
cards for this model have been used in arXiv: 2502.20453, 2505.00272, \
2506.15390."
}], "Text",
